ty <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\gamma (1,p,t\\, v)=\\gamma (t\\cdot 1,p,v)$\">$\\gamma (1,p,t\\, v)=\\gamma (t\\cdot 1,p,v)$</span> of <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-2-6\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-6\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d322d36\">subsection 1.1</a> evaluated at time <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$1$\">$1$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","title":"def:dc-ch3-expmap","label":"def:dc-ch3-expmap"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-6","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-6","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-6"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp","label":"lem:dc-ch3-2-9-dexp"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#prop:dc-ch3-2-9","title":"prop:dc-ch3-2-9","label":"prop:dc-ch3-2-9"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation","title":"lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation","label":"lem:dc-ch8-4-2-propagation"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","title":"lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[the exponential map traces geodesic rays]\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch3-expmap-ray}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch3-expmap, lem:dc-ch3-2-6}\n\n  \\dcref{ch3:after-2.8}\n  For $v\\in T_pM$ and $t$ in the maximal interval of the geodesic with initial\n  data $(p,v)$,\n  $$\\exp_p(t\\,v)=\\gamma(t,p,v).$$\n  In particular $t\\mapsto\\exp_p(t\\,v)$ \\emph{is} the geodesic through $p$ with\n  initial velocity $v$; this is the computational heart of\n  $d(\\exp_p)_0=\\mathrm{id}$ in \\cref{prop:dc-ch3-2-9}.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n\n  For $t=0$ both sides are $p$. For $t\\neq0$ this is the homogeneity\n  $\\gamma(1,p,t\\,v)=\\gamma(t\\cdot 1,p,v)$ of \\cref{lem:dc-ch3-2-6} evaluated at\n  time $1$.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","title":"def:dc-ch3-expmap","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-2-6","title":"lem:dc-ch3-2-6","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}